<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Welcome to <%= appName %></title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px;">
  <div style="border-bottom: 2px solid #2563eb; padding-bottom: 16px; margin-bottom: 24px;">
    <h1 style="margin: 0; font-size: 24px; color: #1e40af;"><%= appName %></h1>
  </div>
  <p>Hello <%= firstName %> <% if (typeof lastName !== 'undefined' && lastName) { %><%= lastName %><% } %>,</p>
  <p>Your account has been created. You can sign in at:</p>
  <p style="margin: 24px 0;">
    <a href="<%= loginUrl %>" style="display: inline-block; background: #2563eb; color: #fff; padding: 12px 24px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px;">Sign in</a>
  </p>
  <p><strong>Important:</strong> You will be asked to change your password on first login for security.</p>
  <p>If you did not expect this email, please contact your administrator.</p>
  <footer style="margin-top: 32px; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280;">
    &copy; <%= year %> <%= appName %>. All rights reserved.
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
